WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.406
A few numbers capture the work.

00:00:02.486 --> 00:00:09.384
Input loss curvature is about three orders of
magnitude cheaper than the Feldman score.

00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:15.640
Ground truth averages a thousand models on CIFAR100
and a hundred on ImageNet.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.052
Privacy sweeps epsilon from one to fifty at delta 1e-5.

00:00:20.132 --> 00:00:23.340
Three theorems tie the triangle together.
